# item30: Plage01 route, walked end to end. No teleport lines. Segments A-D are the measured
# walks from local/reports/item30-plage01-walk.md (hut, beach nav walk incl. the running jump
# over the crate wall, TouchTrigger8/7 + killer, truck return legs + Porte1).
#
# The `weapon XIII.m60` grant is a diagnostic weapon bootstrap that stays: the level's own
# picked-up Beretta is mis-wired to the pawn's fists ammo by the game's decoded pickup chain
# (zero damage; see the report's "Weapon decision"), and fixing that mis-wiring is a separate
# task. The fire/death/corpse-search/inventory work is the game's own code.
#
# The killer (BaseSoldier6) walks while attacking, so the view is tracked onto it around the
# firing (`track BaseSoldier6` / `track off`).

# ---- hut: key, Beretta, door (all walked) ------------------------------------------------
t=45.00 goto -491.84 -314.14
t=45.40 jump
t=45.90 jump
t=46.40 jump
t=46.90 jump
t=47.40 jump
t=47.90 forward 0
