# T8 is touched at ~308 s; its killer-scene chain holds the player controller ~13 s, so the
# killer approach starts after the handback. TouchTrigger7 (tueur_conducteur, r850 at
# 1093,-13854) fires earlier on the shore walk (~287 s) - that is the game's own chain.

# ---- the killer: walked approach (PathNode45 -> AttackPoint47 ReachSpec), then the old
